        "title": {
          "en": "Organizations Unprepared for Agentic AI Adoption",
          "zh": "组织尚未为代理式人工智能应用做好准备"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "A disconnect exists between organizations' ambition to adopt agentic AI and their current operational readiness, despite rapidly growing adoption.",
          "zh": "尽管企业级代理式人工智能应用正在快速增长，但在组织采用代理式人工智能的雄心与其当前运营准备之间存在脱节。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "85% of organizations aim to become agentic within the next three years.",
            "76% of organizations report their current operations and infrastructure are insufficient for agentic AI integration.",
            "A lack of readiness is observed across people, processes, and workflows for supporting agentic AI."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "85% 的组织目标在未来三年内实现代理式AI转型。",
            "76% 的组织表示其当前的运营和基础设施无法支持代理式AI的变革。",
            "在人员、流程和工作流方面，组织缺乏支持代理式AI的准备。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This trend indicates that the widespread implementation of agentic AI agents in enterprises faces significant organizational and infrastructural challenges. The gap between ambition and current capability may slow down broader AI adoption and necessitate strategic planning in organizational design.",
          "zh": "这一趋势表明，企业中代理式AI代理的广泛实施面临重大的组织和基础设施挑战。雄心与当前能力之间的差距可能会减缓更广泛的AI应用，并需要在组织设计中进行战略规划。"
        },
        "source": "MIT Tech Review (AI)",
        "link": "https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/05/26/1137584/rethinking-organizational-design-in-the-age-of-agentic-ai/"
      },
